16	// ============================================================================
17	// CUDA sm_90 launch glue for NeuralGrok.
18	// Algorithm: csrc/algorithms/neuralgrok.h
19	//
20	// Two-stage compute: psi_net forward (per-element MLP on |grad|), then
21	// Adam apply with the amplified gradient. The psi weights live in constant
22	// memory; the launcher copies host-side weights into the constant buffer
23	// before kernel launch.
